## Step 3 — Fetch Data

### Simple load

```razor
@page "/products"
@inject CatalogClient Catalog

@if (products is null)
{
    <p>Loading…</p>
}
else
{
    @foreach (var p in products)
    {
        <p>@p.Name — @p.Price.ToString("C")</p>
    }
}

@code {
    private Product[]? products;

    protected override async Task OnInitializedAsync()
    {
